msgid ""
"⚠ Flat mode (fallback): USVFS bypassed, Anomaly and the mods are merged. "
"You LOSE mod flexibility (no more enabling/disabling via MO2). The merged"
" tree shares its files with the mods (hardlinks): edit mods under "
